*> vybe-test: cobol/numeric_edited/test_numeric_edited_point_comma
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_numeric_edited.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SRC PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 12345.67.
01 WS-EDIT1 PIC 9(5).99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-EDIT2 PIC Z(3),ZZ9.99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE WS-SRC TO WS-EDIT1.
    DISPLAY WS-EDIT1.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-EDIT1 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "12345.67"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [12345.67] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    MOVE WS-SRC TO WS-EDIT2.
    DISPLAY WS-EDIT2.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-EDIT2 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = " 12,345.67"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ 12,345.67] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

